    Neuron NKI - Kernel call: tensor_virus_coalesced(lhs_t = Tensor(shape: (8192, 8192), dtype: bfloat16), rhs = Tensor(shape: (8192, 8192), dtype: bfloat16))
      NKI tensor_virus     78.03     1777            1.0   True
      device = xm.xla_device()
      xm.mark_step()
      xm.mark_step()
    ..
      xm.mark_step()
